ich is 96\u00d75 shifted one position to the left):\n96\u00d75 = 480, so shifted left becomes 4800\nAdding 864 + 4800 gives 5664. Yep, same result. So I'm confident that's correct.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is 5664. The user's initial thought of 5964 is wrong, probably due to an addition error (maybe adding 4800 + 864 as 4800 + 900=5700 minus 36, but that's not right). Anyway, following the problem's instructions, I'll present the correct solution as per the template.\n</think>\n\n",
