ogic applies here. So step 2 is 51*10, which is 510. .\n\nNow, I need to add the results of these two steps together. So adding 255 and 510. Let me do that. 255 + 510. 200 + 500 is 700, and 55 + 10 is 65. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
