se gives 5400 + 180 = 5580. Yep, same result.\n\nNow, according to the template, I need to sum all the step results. So adding the first result (558) and the second result (5580). Let me add those together. 558 + 5580. Hmm, 558 + 5580 is like adding 558 + 5580. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
