ether: 279 (from the ones place) and 2170 (from the tens place). Adding those: 279 + 2170. Let me add them. 2000 + 200 = 2200, 170 +79: 170 +70 is 240, plus 9 is 249. So, let me directly conclude the answer. The answer is "]]
