et me try 85*23 as 85*23:\n\nMultiplying 85 by 23:\n\n       85\n     x23\n     ----\n       255 (85*3)\n      1700 (85*20)\n     ----\n      1955\n\nYes, that's correct. So the user's answer of 1951 is wrong. The correct answer is 1955. So in the template, the user's thought was wrong, but I need to provide the correct reasoning. Let me structure the answer accordingly.\n"]
